# =============================================================================
# NGINX PROXY MANAGER CONFIGURATION FOR PUBLIC ACCESS
# =============================================================================
# Konfigurasi ini digunakan dengan Nginx Proxy Manager (NPM)
# NPM akan melakukan reverse proxy dari domain public ke internal services
#
# IMPORTANT: Update semua URL dibawah dengan domain yang sudah di-setup di NPM!
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. FRONTEND UI URL (Admin Interface)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Domain untuk mengakses Admin UI (demo-app-nextjs di port 3003)
#
# Setup di Nginx Proxy Manager:
#   - Domain Name: oidc-ui.devlab.biz.id
#   - Scheme: http
#   - Forward Hostname/IP: issuer (atau IP host jika NPM di server terpisah)
#   - Forward Port: 3003
#   - Enable: Websockets Support, Block Common Exploits
#   - SSL: Request SSL Certificate (Let's Encrypt)
#
# Isi dengan URL ngrok aktif kamu, contoh:
# NGROK_URL=https://abcd-1234.ngrok-free.app
NGROK_URL=https://945c-140-213-70-217.ngrok-free.app

CLOUDFLARE_TUNNEL_URL=${NGROK_URL}

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. OID4VCI ENDPOINT (Credential Issuance API - Port 8082)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Endpoint utama untuk OpenID4VCI protocol
# Service: issuer (port 8082)
# Wallet akan mengakses endpoint ini untuk:
#   - /.well-known/openid-credential-issuer (metadata)
#   - /token (token endpoint)
#   - /credential (credential issuance)
#
# Setup di Nginx Proxy Manager:
#   - Domain Name: oidc-api.devlab.biz.id
#   - Scheme: http
#   - Forward Hostname/IP: issuer (atau IP host)
#   - Forward Port: 8082
#   - Enable: Websockets Support, Block Common Exploits
#   - SSL: Request SSL Certificate (Let's Encrypt)
#   - Custom Nginx Config (Advanced tab):
#       # Increase timeout for credential issuance
#       proxy_read_timeout 300;
#       proxy_connect_timeout 300;
#       proxy_send_timeout 300;
#
OID4VCI_ENDPOINT=${NGROK_URL}

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. OID4VCI PUBLIC ENDPOINT (untuk Wallet Access)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Endpoint yang akan digunakan oleh wallet untuk mengakses credential issuer
# Biasanya sama dengan OID4VCI_ENDPOINT kecuali ada load balancer tambahan
#
OID4VCI_PUBLIC_ENDPOINT=${NGROK_URL}

# URL lama yang masih keluar dari ACA-Py/credential offer, akan diganti ke NGROK_URL di frontend.
# Jangan ubah ini kecuali credential offer lama mengandung domain lain.
ISSUER_URL_TO_REPLACE=https://oidc-api.devlab.biz.id

# =============================================================================
# NGINX PROXY MANAGER SETUP GUIDE
# =============================================================================
#
# Prerequisites:
# 1. Nginx Proxy Manager sudah running
# 2. Docker network untuk NPM dan aplikasi ini harus sama atau bisa communicate
# 3. Domain sudah pointing ke IP server NPM
#
# Setup Steps di NPM UI (http://npm-ip:81):
#
# A. PROXY HOST #1 - Admin UI (Port 3003)
#    ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
#    │ Details Tab:                                                │
#    │   Domain Names: oidc-ui.devlab.biz.id                     │
#    │   Scheme: http                                              │
#    │   Forward Hostname/IP: demo-app-nextjs (container name)     │
#    │                     atau <host-ip> jika external            │
#    │   Forward Port: 3003                                        │
#    │   Cache Assets: ✓                                           │
#    │   Block Common Exploits: ✓                                  │
#    │   Websockets Support: ✓                                     │
#    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
#    ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
#    │ SSL Tab:                                                    │
#    │   SSL Certificate: Request a new SSL Certificate            │
#    │   Force SSL: ✓                                              │
#    │   HTTP/2 Support: ✓                                         │
#    │   HSTS Enabled: ✓                                           │
#    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
#
# B. PROXY HOST #2 - OID4VCI API (Port 8082)
#    ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
#    │ Details Tab:                                                │
#    │   Domain Names: oidc-api.devlab.biz.id                    │
#    │   Scheme: http                                              │
#    │   Forward Hostname/IP: issuer (container name)              │
#    │                     atau <host-ip> jika external            │
#    │   Forward Port: 8082                                        │
#    │   Block Common Exploits: ✓                                  │
#    │   Websockets Support: ✓                                     │
#    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
#    ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
#    │ SSL Tab:                                                    │
#    │   SSL Certificate: Request a new SSL Certificate            │
#    │   Force SSL: ✓                                              │
#    │   HTTP/2 Support: ✓                                         │
#    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
#    ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
#    │ Advanced Tab (Custom Nginx Configuration):                 │
#    │   # Increase timeout for credential operations              │
#    │   proxy_read_timeout 300;                                   │
#    │   proxy_connect_timeout 300;                                │
#    │   proxy_send_timeout 300;                                   │
#    │                                                              │
#    │   # Preserve original host header                           │
#    │   proxy_set_header Host $host;                              │
#    │   proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;                  │
#    │   proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for; │
#    │   proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;               │
#    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
#
# =============================================================================
# DOCKER NETWORK CONFIGURATION
# =============================================================================
#
# Jika NPM dan aplikasi ini di server yang sama:
# 1. Pastikan keduanya di network yang sama, atau
# 2. Gunakan nama container sebagai hostname
# 3. Atau gunakan host.docker.internal (Mac/Windows) atau 172.17.0.1 (Linux)
#
# Jika NPM di server terpisah:
# 1. Expose port 3003 dan 8082 ke host
# 2. Gunakan IP host di NPM Forward Hostname/IP
# 3. Pastikan firewall mengizinkan akses dari NPM server
#
# =============================================================================
# PORT MAPPING REFERENCE
# =============================================================================
# Service                Port    NPM Setup Required    Description
# ---------------------  ------  --------------------  ---------------------
# demo-app-nextjs        3003    YES (Public)          Admin UI
# issuer (OID4VCI)       8082    YES (Public)          Wallet API
# issuer (ACA-Py Admin)  3001    Optional (Internal)   Admin API
# issuer (DIDComm)       3000    No (Internal only)    DIDComm messaging
# demo-app               3005    Optional              Legacy UI
# webhook-listener       8080    No (Internal only)    Webhook receiver
#
# =============================================================================
